    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tralalero Tralala vs Bombordiro Crocodilo, who to choose? It's a fighting game based on a famous meme: fight with your friends and win while playing as your favorite characters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/56abd22033634c2afdfc988ef8ee2b0f.avif?t=1751561626\" width=650 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/075b464ccc5c7b57ea0cd2220554a024.poster.avif?t=1751561626\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/075b464ccc5c7b57ea0cd2220554a024.webm?t=1751561626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/075b464ccc5c7b57ea0cd2220554a024.mp4?t=1751561626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Check out 8 cool heroes at the start!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your favorite, show off your skills and smash your friends in epic battles! Each hero has a unique animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/9a72574e12615568a1de8385131943df.avif?t=1751561626\" width=650 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/a631e11676f81479ae2c7db18e9550da.poster.avif?t=1751561626\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/a631e11676f81479ae2c7db18e9550da.webm?t=1751561626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/a631e11676f81479ae2c7db18e9550da.mp4?t=1751561626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Combine attacks, block in time and use your ultimate to turn the tide of battle. Each fight is unique due to individual character animations and a wide variety of blows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/767bcc17654383608f7158c3ebc022ec.avif?t=1751561626\" width=650 height=91 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/a9194b5508a7b090e446383a44473d75.poster.avif?t=1751561626\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/a9194b5508a7b090e446383a44473d75.webm?t=1751561626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337680/extras/a9194b5508a7b090e446383a44473d75.mp4?t=1751561626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Absolutely every character from a famous meme. Do you love tung tung tung sahur like me? Then pick him and bend absolutely everyone in your way!</p>",
